        <p>The death of Lady Sykes, wife of Sir Tatton Sykes in London, after an Illness of a few hours only, is announced. She was a daughter of Mr. George Augustus Canvendish-Bentinck, and was married to Sir Tatum Sykes, the fifth baronet, 1871. The present member of Parliament for Central Hull is their only son.</p>
