        <p>Miss Mary Bryan. of Frankfort Lodr, on Ihe Dundrum-road, near Dublin ,celebrated her ruath birth- day on Saturday. The old lady was in capital s) i-its She did full justice at dinner time to a chop and potatoes and some pudding.</p>
