        <p>MR. E. G. HEMMERDE, K.C., M.P. North-West Norfolk has chosen Mr. E. G. Hemmerde, K.C., as its representative in Parliament. Mr. Hemmerde was Liberal Member for East Denbighshire from 1906- 1910. He is Recorder of -Liverpool, and the author of the play "A Butterfly on the , Wheel.",</p>
