        <p>0</p>
        <p>Buckley-street P.S.A.</p>
        <p>The monthly meeting of the above society was held last Sunday with a fair number of members and friends present. The chair was taken at 3 o'clock by Mr. James Urmston, and the speaker was Mr. Hindle. An excel- lent programme WAS contributed to by Mr.rA. Palmer, solo violinist ; Miss M. Keen, soprano ; and Mr. Atkinson, of Leigh. Miss Lea was the pianist.</p>
