        <p>So nourishing and easily digested, it is beneficial day or night. En- ables you to assimilate all the health - giving qualities of other food. Doctors and nurses recom- mend) Horlick's. Malted Barley, Wheat and Milk in powder form —977,'c, nourishment.</p>
